   <Season id="GreatFast">
      <Section>
         <Title>
            <Language id="English">Adam Aspasmos</Language>
            <Language id="Arabic">الاسبسمس الادام</Language>
            <Language id="Coptic">Je ,~ouws m~v~mou...</Language>
         </Title>
         
         <Comment>
            <Language id="English">         
               For the Great Fast:
            </Language>
         </Comment>

         <Text>
            <Language id="Coptic">
               Je ,~ouws m~v~mou an m~pirefernobi: m~v~r/] n~teftacyof: n~tecw~nq n~je tef'u,/
            </Language>
            <Language id="English">
               For You desire not the death of the sinner, but that he returns: that his soul may live.
            </Language>
            <Language id="Arabic">
               لأنك لا تشاء موت الخاطئ مثل أن يرجع وتحيا نفسه.
            </Language>         
         </Text>
         
         <Text>
            <Language id="Coptic">
               Matacyon V]: e~qoun e~pekoujai: a~rioui neman: kata tekmeta~gayoc
            </Language>
            <Language id="English">
               Return us God, unto Your salvation, and deal with us according to Your goodness.
            </Language>
            <Language id="Arabic">
               ردنا يا الله إلى خلاصك واصنع معنا كصلاحك.
            </Language>         
         </Text>
         
